         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Two improvements to the dynamic wake meandering model: including the effects of atmospheric shear on wake turbulence and incorporating turbulence build-up in a row of wind turbines</rdf:li>
